        "text": "top of page\nClose\nCLICK HERE to meet Bryna at a Neighborhood Gathering!\n♡ DONATE NOW\nENDORSE BRYNA →\n## I grew up in Palo Alto, raised my family here, and spent decades volunteering in our schools and serving our city. Now I am ready to serve you on City Council.\n## Help Send Bryna to City Council.\n##### Take a yard sign\nShow your support - request a sign for your front yard.\nREQUEST\n##### Take a yard sign\nShow your support - request a sign for your front yard.\nREQUEST\n##### Endorse Bryna\nAdd your name to the growing list of community endorsers.\nENDORSE\n##### Lend a hand\nVolunteer your time to support events and outreach.\nSIGN UP\n##### Donate\nFund yard signs, mailers, and advertising.\nGIVE\nCelebrating my campaign kick off with other Palo Alto leaders\nClick above to read the Palo Alto Daily Post's endorsement of my candidacy for City Council\nClick the video above to listen to my campaign kick off speech\nClick above to listen to former Palo Alto Mayor and current Vice Mayor Greer Stone's support for my candidacy\nClick above to listen to former Palo Alto Mayor and current Councilmember Pat Burt's support for my candidacy\nClick above to read the first Palo Alto Weekly article about my candidacy\nClick above to watch the Palo Alto City Council Candidate Forum hosted by League of Women Voters\nClick above to watch the Palo Alto City Candidate Forum hosted by Palo Alto Neighborhoods\nClick above to watch the Palo Alto City Council Candidate Forum hosted by SVH Action Fund\nClick above to read the Palo Alto Daily Post article about my views on city planning\nEnjoying our backyard concert campaign fundraiser with Melodious Thunk & Co.\nAttending the Palo Alto Pride event this summer\nMeeting with Buena Vista Mobile Home Park residents as they prepare for relocation\nMeeting Palo Alto residents\nAnswering questions about my goals for Palo Alto\nCelebrating my campaign kick off with other Palo Alto leaders\nClick above to read the Palo Alto Daily Post's endorsement of my candidacy for City Council\nClick the video above to listen to my campaign kick off speech\nClick above to listen to former Palo Alto Mayor and current Vice Mayor Greer Stone's support for my candidacy\nClick above to listen to former Palo Alto Mayor and current Councilmember Pat Burt's support for my candidacy\nClick above to read the first Palo Alto Weekly article about my candidacy\nClick above to watch the Palo Alto City Council Candidate Forum hosted by League of Women Voters\nClick above to watch the Palo Alto City Candidate Forum hosted by Palo Alto Neighborhoods\nClick above to watch the Palo Alto City Council Candidate Forum hosted by SVH Action Fund\nClick above to read the Palo Alto Daily Post article about my views on city planning\nEnjoying our backyard concert campaign fundraiser with Melodious Thunk & Co.\nAttending the Palo Alto Pride event this summer\nMeeting with Buena Vista Mobile Home Park residents as they prepare for relocation\nMeeting Palo Alto residents\nAnswering questions about my goals for Palo Alto\n## On the Campaign Trail with Bryna.\nbottom of page",
